      <div type="clause" n="El. 48">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> El. 48</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ne swergen ge næfre under hæðne godas, ne on nanum ðingum ne cleopien ge to him.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Never swear by heathen gods, nor shall you invoke them in any respect [in the course of litigation?]</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ne swergen ge næfre under hæðne godas, ne on nanum þingum ne clipien ge to heom.</ab>
      </div>
